  "intuition": "Leverages a probabilistic pairwise ranking loss using advantage signals to better capture relative quality differences, employing a sigmoid link on advantage-weighted log probability differences, aggregated via a weighted sum.",
  "pseudocode": "prob = sigmoid(scale * advantage_gap * (log_prob_w - log_prob_l))\nloss = -weight * log(prob + eps)\nloss = sum(loss) / sum(weight)",
